@startuml state_hmi
title HMI source states and transport recovery
[*] --> Connecting
Connecting --> Connecting : connect failure / retry + optional discovery
Connecting --> NoVessel : paired kRPC session, active vessel null
Connecting --> Flight : paired session, active vessel available
NoVessel --> Flight : active vessel becomes available
Flight --> NoVessel : vessel disappears / scene changes
Flight --> Flight : optional field error / omit value and retry
Flight --> Connecting : connection error / close session
NoVessel --> Connecting : connection error
Connecting --> [*] : stop
NoVessel --> [*] : stop
Flight --> [*] : stop
note right of Flight : Snapshot age >3 seconds is stale data,\nnot a separate State enum value.
note right of NoVessel : Known UDP context selects facility view.\nNo context leaves a generic waiting view.
@enduml
